WEBVTT

00:05:29.367 --> 00:05:32.244
We need green building retrofitters

00:05:32.286 --> 00:05:35.456
and wind turbine installers
and bike lane planners.

00:05:35.498 --> 00:05:39.085
We need culture shapers and policy nerds.

00:05:39.502 --> 00:05:44.090
We need employees pushing
their corporate employers to change.

00:05:45.633 --> 00:05:49.678
(Applause)

00:05:49.720 --> 00:05:51.555
Here's where I will offer

00:05:51.597 --> 00:05:57.269
what I consider to be the sexiest word
in the English language:

00:05:57.978 --> 00:05:59.563
implementation.

00:05:59.605 --> 00:06:02.149
(Laughter)